\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Father, whose everlasting love
\par Thy only Son for sinners gave,
\par Whose grace to all did freely move,
\par And sent Him down the world to save:
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Help us Thy mercy to extol,
\par Immense, unfathomed, unconfined;
\par To praise the Lamb who died for all,
\par The general Saviour of mankind.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Thy undistinguishing regard
\par Was cast on Adam's fallen race;
\par For all Thou hast in Christ prepared
\par Sufficient, sovereign, saving grace.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. The world He suffered to redeem;
\par For all He hath the atonement made;
\par For those that will not come to Him
\par The ransom of His life was paid.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Arise, O God, maintain Thy cause!
\par The fullness of the Gentiles call;
\par Lift up the standard of Thy Cross,
\par And all shall own Thou diedst for all.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

